{title: Hosanna}
{artist: Hillsong en Español}
{composer: Brooke Ligertwood}
{key: E}
{source: https://www.cifraclub.com/hillsong-en-espaol/hosanna/}

{start_of_intro}
[C#m9]   [E9]   [F#m9]   [G#4]
[C#m7(11)]   [E7M(9)]   [F#m7(11)]   [G#m7]
[C#m7(11)]   [E7M(9)]   [F#m7(11)]   [G#m7]
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Primera Parte}
[E]
Veo al rey de Gloria
[C#m]
Viene con fuego y poder
[F#m]
Todos verán
[B]       [C#m7]
Todos verán
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Segunda Parte}
[E]
Veo Su amor y gracia
[C#m]
Mi pecado perdonó
[F#m]
Le alabaré
[B]
Le alabaré
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [C#m]  [B]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [B]  [C#m]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tercera Parte}
[E]
Veo cómo se levanta
[C#m]
Una gran generación
[F#m]
Con compasión
[B]  [B4]  [B]
Con compasión
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Cuarta Parte}
[E]
Veo avivamiento
[C#m]
Al buscarte y al orar
[F#m]
Me postraré
[B]
Me postraré
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [C#m]  [B]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [B]
Hosanna en las alturas
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_solo}
[C#m]   [E]   [F#m]   [G#m]
[C#m]   [E]   [F#m]   [G#m]
{end_of_solo}

{start_of_bridge: Puente}
[A]              [B]
Sáname y límpiame
[E]                              [C#m]
Con mis ojos Tus obras quiero ver
[A]                    [B]         [C#m]
Quiero amarte como Tú me amas
[A]               [B]
Muéstrame Tu corazón
[E]                            [C#m]
Todo lo que soy por Tu reino Dios
[A]
Contigo quiero estar
[B]              [A2]
Por la eternidad
{comment: A2 riff over final line — see tab on Cifra Club}
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Coro Final}
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [C#m]  [B]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [B]  [E]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [C#m]  [B]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[E/G#]  [A]  [B]    [C#m]
Hosan___na Hosanna
[A]              [B]  [C#m]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[A]              [B]  [C#m]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[A]              [B]  [C#m]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
[A]              [B]  [E]
Hosanna en las altu___ras
{end_of_chorus}
